  _text: 'Anne and I had two children: Sophie in 1977 and Pierre in 1980. We bought
    a modest house in the suburbs, with a garden where the kids played football.
    On weekends, we went hiking in the forest or visited castles. It was everyday
    happiness, with lively birthdays and Christmases.'
